            <div xml:id="m-9aa474ce-abe9-4660-bc66-f4f5877f1f60">
              <lg xml:id="m-a3c0b5d0-ec56-4571-a131-9d22f014aee2">
                <l xml:id="m-a2a923a3-731c-4cd2-9f43-80c705862383" facs="#m-53f2708f-e808-4325-b046-7e71cae51e46" label="ambiguous">230</l><l xml:id="m-db0719cb-be2b-4a74-9206-c227dd3eda59" facs="#m-50dc48e7-b41a-49c5-ab76-157cc399773c" label="text-like">Sunday at Prime.</l><l xml:id="m-540fc786-2a7e-457d-8ae2-44c531429169" facs="#m-2f844cc5-9cd1-4bf2-97a0-8bd6f7d2e428" label="ambiguous">Short Resp. during Advent.</l><l xml:id="m-dcb944ce-a6ea-40e3-b2a3-280f952017ae" facs="#m-eb689e1a-f36f-4ea8-98e9-1fc884e6d798" label="lyrics-like">Hríste Fi-li Dé-i vi-vi,“Mi-se-ré-re nóbis. Chríste.</l><l xml:id="m-6070d1f3-92bc-4f1e-9ac8-b09316f1d0ec" facs="#m-8e1920ed-27ef-45d0-84df-df8ea48a66b4" label="lyrics-like">TV. Qui ventúrus es in múndum. “Mi-se-ré-re nóbis.</l><l xml:id="m-4a7d8191-1130-48e6-ab68-c9b2a85ea139" facs="#m-07d8c275-b31c-4597-809b-9d28ad3cdec4" label="lyrics-like">V. Gló-ri-a Pátri, et Fi-li-o, et Spi-rítu-i Sáncto.</l><l xml:id="m-24aa07b6-7c28-404d-b557-0b7ed835024c" facs="#m-74ba660a-c29a-458a-af58-b988d7261da7" label="lyrics-like">Chríste.</l><l xml:id="m-8be1821f-d48a-4f5a-bdc4-44b052de575d" facs="#m-19225be0-2edf-4bab-b10b-83a861b479d4" label="lyrics-like">F. Exsúrge Christe, ádjuva nos.</l><l xml:id="m-65c71fae-eb3e-4593-bb09-f6b10de89dd5" facs="#m-e529fe67-0e0d-4e07-a155-6b49481d41ea" label="lyrics-like">K. Et libera nos propter nómen túum.</l><l xml:id="m-6f469b96-701f-4f1f-9bf8-58233f3b4993" facs="#m-60cada0f-db09-44fa-aa3a-75a85acb988b" label="ambiguous">*</l><l xml:id="m-419cbd45-09c0-4184-8da8-c3a8c4bbfd59" facs="#m-3c9ce3ff-470f-4788-8092-eecf3cfea1a9" label="text-like">On the Feast of the Immaculate Conception and during the Octave sivith</l><l xml:id="m-c3f54402-8a5d-4e25-a9e5-4a6fdde17e74" facs="#m-40b1b6ba-8e84-4bad-9faa-02c205cc830c" label="lyrics-like">the exception of the Sunday within the Octave, and of the Õctave day itself it</l><l xml:id="m-ac573ac2-3064-49b3-a238-16ebae21d049" facs="#m-1a5db4b0-9ddf-45ab-8ebc-20c4cffe68bb" label="lyrics-like">this shoüld fall on a Sundav), the following is said:</l><l xml:id="m-6342dc4f-9857-4d53-8fca-ba3001c712ee" facs="#m-8028ae8d-da02-42e2-9f98-9d12ed8b0c27" label="lyrics-like">V. Qui ná-tus es de Ma-rí-a Virgine.</l><l xml:id="m-3c0b5405-eab5-4539-8c16-a9b9a0d68650" facs="#m-f8aa0f41-ae8f-4d6e-bf5c-96e82d849844" label="text-like">Short Resp. in Paschal Time.</l><l xml:id="m-2b8740f8-0284-44b1-a473-372d0e74dfed" facs="#m-ce5df05b-d80f-4edb-a076-b215af7b374f" label="ambiguous">6.</l><l xml:id="m-e662f731-3a33-4b5d-b912-3226a0e25d36" facs="#m-5ee797d6-029e-4525-bdff-ea0e367a4941" label="lyrics-like">Hriste Fi-li Dé-i ví-vi, mi-se-ré-re nóbis : “Alle-lú-ia,</l><l xml:id="m-e7bb48de-9a42-483d-9aed-9ad52231eff0" facs="#m-09fe2d8a-369c-4085-b2ee-a270ea965726" label="lyrics-like">alle-lú-ia. Chríste. T V. Qui surrexísti a mórtu-is."Alle¬</l><l xml:id="m-b741536c-b616-49b8-850a-7e8feaa16a46" facs="#m-f2e848bc-bf78-4d36-8df6-a01de1916845" label="lyrics-like">lú-ia, alle-lúia. V. Gló-ri-a Pátri, et Spi¬</l><l xml:id="m-946f153b-b023-4497-b85b-c58ed265fc81" facs="#m-d6b56aef-790d-473a-b65f-e097f8c3b589" label="lyrics-like">tu-i Sáncto. Chríste.</l><l xml:id="m-1ff469d3-8367-45a8-8571-f252c7ed0c6e" facs="#m-5034ca55-6af6-4d06-ae92-2d2acdbcde2b" label="lyrics-like">V. Exsúrge Christe, ádiuva nos, alleluia.</l><l xml:id="m-62f7e987-1278-4587-89ef-cf257054a1c7" facs="#m-9f4b6258-f1d7-4eae-9447-398399ad8efb" label="lyrics-like">H. Et libera nos propter nómen túum, allelúia.</l></lg>
            </div>
          </section>
        </score>
      </mdiv>
    </body>
  </music>
</mei>